Question1:Given the CITY and COUNTRY tables, query the sum of the populations of all cities where the CONTINENT is 'Asia'.



#solution-

select sum(CITY.POPULATION)
from CITY CITY join COUNTRY COUNTRY
on CITY.CountryCode= COUNTRY.Code 
where COUNTRY.CONTINENT='asia';
